# SPA fallback — Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, Render.
#
# The app uses `createBrowserRouter`, so /login, /signup and /forgot-password
# are client-side routes with no matching file on disk. Without this rule a
# direct hit or a refresh on any of them returns a hard 404 (verified against a
# plain static server). `vite preview` has this fallback built in, which is why
# local testing never surfaces it.
#
# 200, not 301: rewrite in place so the URL the visitor typed is preserved and
# React Router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
